        "sectionId": "split-band",
        "values": {
          "eyebrow": "",
          "heading": "",
          "body": "Get your semi-truck back on the road faster by entrusting the Truck Country semi-truck body shop in Indianapolis, Indiana, conveniently located and accessible from Interstate 465. Our semi-truck body shop team is solely focused on your repair and maintenance needs. Our Indianapolis semi-truck body shop specializes in working on Freightliner and Western Star brands and just about any brand of truck! We offer complete and comprehensive services–including body repairs, glass replacement, alignments, and day cab conversions–from a single location. Technicians use the latest technology such as the state-of-the-art frame straightening machine, Josam Play Detectors, and the heated Devilbliss paint booth. From semi-truck bodywork to complete detailing of all makes and models, it pays to give the team of experts at Indianapolis a call!",
          "image": {
            "src": "https://www.truckcountry.com/efs/wp/domains/www.truckcountry.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/10/IMG_8686-300x200.jpg",
            "alt": "Body shop work 1",
